{'symbol': 'URI', 'date': '2021-08-13 08:52:00', 'title': 'UNITED RENTALS ANNOUNCES FULL REDEMPTION OF 5.875% SENIOR NOTES DUE 2026', 'text': 'STAMFORD, CONN.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--UNITED RENTALS, INC. (NYSE: URI) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS SUBSIDIARY, UNITED RENTALS (NORTH AMERICA), INC. (“URNA”), HAS GIVEN NOTICE OF ITS INTENTION TO REDEEM ALL OF THE OUTSTANDING $1.0 BILLION PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF ITS 5.875% SENIOR NOTES DUE 2026 (CUSIP NUMBER 911365 BE3) (THE “NOTES”) ON SEPTEMBER 15, 2021 (THE “REDEMPTION DATE”). THE NOTES WILL BE REDEEMED AT A REDEMPTION PRICE (THE “REDEMPTION PRICE”) OF 102.938% OF THE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF THE NOTES, PLUS'}